endDrag:

```js
function endDrag(){
  const {li, ghost} = active; active = null;
  ul.classList.remove('is-reordering');
  li.classList.remove('is-ghost-src');
  const r = li.getBoundingClientRect();
  ghost.style.transition = 'transform .16s ease, opacity .16s ease';
  ghost.style.transform = `translate(${r.left}px, ${r.top}px)`;
  ghost.style.opacity = '0';
  setTimeout(() => ghost.remove(), 180);
}
```

Since the ghost was positioned at left:0/top:0 with a transform — yes, I set left:0 top:0 in CSS.

