Also add a small hint inside each pane? Original lead is in the head: "Разместите блоки в порядке от наиболее похожего на вас до наименее похожего" — keep in the dialog head (always visible). Good.

Also add a hint line below the lead: "Перетащите элементы (на телефоне — за рукоятку)" in small muted text. This helps usability. Discretionary.

Now writing the file.

I accidentally cut off the template at `button` (wrote it as a draft with the wiring section incomplete). Let's complete the wiring section and the end of the file. I'll rewrite the entire tail end of the script:

```js
  btnPrev.addEventListener('click', function(){ setStep(step - 1); });
  btnNext.addEventListener('click', function(){ setStep(step + 1); });
  btnFinish.addEventListener('click', showResult);
