Potential CSS issue: `.disc-modal` is position fixed inset 0 display none; `.is-open{display:block}`, dialog is margin auto — no problem.

The hero CTA's `button` includes an svg with a transform translate — no problem.

`html.no-scroll` + body — but when the modal is open, body is full-height anyway.

